855134128", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "bugsupclose.png", "id": "387132031077469", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75630188_387132034410802_3629908537715767884_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DfO93n80FN0Q7kNvwHLBbke&_nc_oc=AdqcpSOwIdeazpxUIJjcmpqTYBTLHc1fRNNuyhK_q8_uQsQVUmlTKATCS8DCHNi95Fg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEb-FExBvDhnWMciyvKeo2Tqj2sLahGaMrcd-zJU7vRKw&oe=6A940BBB"}, {"file_name": "lawer desk.png", "id": "1021730339243891", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974725_1021730342577224_5121892752200566930_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rn0WjIOH_CIQ7kNvwFdWmmw&_nc_oc=AdoYCr_ePsDJFwMNI7pWO1quNWnqg26vbzNpg1q2bYOK4-tttTFS7oF63qFOMb1SJC4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFInEECi-cRJJhQ9lFz9GEdTIsIwPYqIHFp9v9i3ECU6Q&oe=6A940023"}, {"file_name": "certificatemachine.png", "id": "419222644501284", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031359_419222647834617_1044340319385662871_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oMwlQpZEZqkQ7kNvwHDHPks&_nc_oc=AdoT7PECClUr7LBSJbTMp6pi_fUU-4JzNRoGHZtmSTUdrS8Ja5Yegml_VqVYRnfzUG8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGQIDBI77BUVFZ2U02mO4tsJpXGuaOI2IYP3ALbXwLMXw&oe=6A940B47"}, {"file_name": "gustav.png", "id": "1041151010314056", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982712_1041151013647389_9208282846641755977_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iJ1eLJxYuQ8Q7kNvwFl-Ey8&_nc_oc=AdrSQmyrQeC-vxsu-COqZRdvtS6lSfO97Qz4zwTHyfjDYVeVvb3JwG11O5d8fYEDWMo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFXqBY77VYFW_1H5BriMRuBqtMQOcU9cm67SWwdcJbOEA&oe=6A9410B1"}, {"file_name": "lawyers head-resize.png", "id": "409356922173502", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984472_409356925506835_675175198628609171_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wOLIvgi7Mq0Q7kNvwE8TdMJ&_nc_oc=AdrbkwlKyvq8rIYZICT_bwnZWqX_cu8RNG9M57PczraudaEozJ90KvzD1we94BBv4d4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEWTBBfSgvQItU9YBzb7STEE9Qqw2_V1RPbqt0cvxMOaw&oe=6A941EEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "1568747630685050", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031482_1568747634018383_5207621578584535018_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ed9gbLn21_IQ7kNvwGbBNsm&_nc_oc=AdrAgelkkjVsZZUMQ1fRu2JMn4kwdVhnrx3tDYevkgkURvR3pwsf6Osc86StaLwPEFQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHwiLH721iDtZsW_ddqQtpI87qzezgwVCJ1QkjB-9dEcw&oe=6A93FD89"}, "display_name": "Metamorphosis", "keywords": ["bug", "meta", "puzzle", "escape", "mystery"], "long_description": "# **An Extraordinary Journey Through a Surreal World**\n\n---\n\nIf navigating daily life in 1900s Vienna isn\u2019t complicated enough for Gregor, things take a truly Kafkaesque turn one morning when he awakens to discover he\u2019s been transformed into... a **cockroach**.\n\n### Armed with only your **wit** and **strange new appendages**, embark on a mind-bending journey to unravel the mystery behind your *metamorphosis*.\n\n### \n\n### **Welcome to a World Unlike Any Other**\n\nIn this surreal world, everyday objects loom like towering giants, while dizzying heights challenge your step, and each turn begins a new adventure.\n\n\n#### What to expect:\n- **Dance** all night in a bug's nightclub  \n- **Delve** into arthropod-organized crime  \n- **Dodge** the hands of mammoth humans  \n- **Escape** the bureaucratic traps of buggy officials\n\n---\n\n**But beware**, your friend\u2019s life is hanging by a thread, and your only hope to regain human form lies deep within the heart of a mysterious **Tower**\u2014a place with its own plans for you.\n\n---\n\n### Metamorphosis is a first-person **adventure-platformer** set in a surreal, beautifully twisted world, where your newfound abilities as an insect are your only hope for redemption.\n### \nWill you **avoid the Tower** and **save your friend**? Or will you be **lost forever** in this strange, curious land?\n\n---\n\n# *Embrace the challenge. Escape the Tower. Your metamorphosis awaits.*\n", "short_description": "If navigating daily life in 1900s Vienna isn\u2019t complicated enough for Gregor, things take a Kafkaesque turn one morning when he awakens to discover he\u2019s transformed into a cockroach. Armed with only your wits and some strange new appendages, set off on an extraordinary journey to unravel the mystery of your metamorphosis. \n\nMetamorphosis is a first-person adventure set in a surreal world filled with strange and curious denizens where your newfound abilities are your only hope for redemption."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://blacksunproductions.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Black Sun Productions Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.blacksunproductions.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7251689064878355"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__